    <a id="comment-1852" class="header-offset"></a>
    <article>
      <header>
        <p><a href="/tag/06ML#comment-1852">Comment #1852</a>
        by
        <cite>Matthew Emerton</cite>
        on <time datetime="2016-03-01 23:21:52">March 01, 2016 at 23:21 </time>
      </header>

      <blockquote><p>Just before 82.11.7, you say that you will prove the existence of residual gerbes later, but rather than giving the reference, you have "(insert future reference here)".  In the footnote, you actually give the reference to where this is done, in section 83.21, but it would be good to put it in the main body of the text too.</p></blockquote>
    </article>
  
    <a id="comment-1891" class="header-offset"></a>
